(7506016, 1196398, 19825, '<td valign="top">I was fascinated by this image. Intriguing mix of patterns and lines, distortion and grid. Nicely done. <br/> <br/>I can certainly see why you included the right portion of the image in the whole, but I might have experimented in processing to bring up the vibrancy and warmth of that side to balance things with the left. But, who knows?</td>', 'I was fascinated by this image. Intriguing mix of patterns and lines, distortion and grid. Nicely done.  I can certainly see why you included the right portion of the image in the whole, but I might have experimented in processing to bring up the vibrancy and warmth of that side to balance things with the left. But, who knows?', '2017-03-22 10:23:16.000000', NULL, 0),
